{
    "title": "Carista OBD2",
    "description": "Carista App is a mobile DIY car mechanic in the palm of your hands - code features, diagnose warning lights, monitor live data, and service your car.\r\n\r\nSave time and money from visits to the workshop with Carista. Customize your car\u2019s behavior, unlock hidden features, diagnose dashboard warning lights, monitor real-time parameters, and perform simple DIY procedures quickly and easily. Advanced app settings available for certain Audi, BMW, Infiniti, Lexus, Land Rover, Lincoln, MINI, Nissan, Scion, SEAT, \u0160koda, Toyota, Volkswagen, and Ford models.\r\n\r\n\r\nTHE ALL-IN-ONE CAR TOOL\r\n-Customize your car's behavior: unlock hidden features, including SFD-protected ones, and tailor your car to your preferences.\r\n-Diagnose and Reset dashboard warning lights: quickly identify and resolve issues before they escalate into costly repairs.\r\n-Monitor real-time parameters: stay informed about your car's health and performance with live data readings.\r\n-Perform simple DIY procedures: save on routine maintenance and avoid lengthy workshop visits.\r\n\r\n\r\nSUPPORTED VEHICLES\r\nCarista App supports certain Audi, BMW, Infiniti, Lexus, Land Rover, Lincoln, MINI, Nissan, Scion, SEAT, \u0160koda, Toyota, Volkswagen and Ford models. Check if your car is supported here: https://carista.com/supported-cars\r\n\r\n\r\nWHY THE CARISTA APP?\r\n- A wide range of car brands supported.\r\n- User-friendly and simple: plug the scanner, switch Bluetooth on, press \u201cConnect\u201d, see what your car is capable of.\r\n- Brilliant customer service.\r\n- Frequent updates: new features and brands.\r\n\r\n\r\nHARDWARE\r\nExperience the full potential of the Carista App by pairing it with the Carista EVO Scanner (and Carista OBD Scanner-white one-, not compatible with Ford brands and SFD-protected 2020+ VAG cars). While Carista App can also be used with other compatible OBD2 adapters such as OBDLink MX+, OBDLink CX, OBDLink MX Bluetooth or LX adapters, Kiwi3 adapter, or a genuine Bluetooth ELM327 v1.4 (ensuring it's not fake or defective). Discover more at: https://carista.com/en/adapters\r\n\r\n\r\nPRICING\r\nAll paid features are available with an in-app purchase of our Pro functionality: an auto-renewable subscription at $59.99 USD/year or $29.99 USD/3 months or $14.99 USD/month. If you use the official Carista EVO Scanner, you will receive a free one-month trial of all paid features by picking the yearly subscription.\r\nPrice may vary based on currency and region.\r\n\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES (Exact feature availability depends on your vehicle).\r\n\r\n*CUSTOMIZATIONS\r\nPersonalization of comfort & convenience features of the car. More than 300 hidden features per brand.\r\n\r\n-Gauge needle sweep at startup\r\n-Start screen logo\r\n-Virtual instrument cluster theme\r\n-Lights: DRL, coming/ leaving-home\r\n-Throttle response behavior\r\nand more powerful features to enhance your experience!\r\n\r\n\r\n*ADVANCED DIAGNOSTICS\r\nPerform dealer-level electronic diagnostics (fault code checking and resetting) of all modules in the vehicle, including ABS, airbag, and other manufacturer-specific systems.\r\n\r\n\r\n*SERVICE\r\nPerform simple service procedures without the mechanic\u2019s help and spare yourself the long waiting time and extra costs at the workshop.\r\n\r\n-Electronic parking brake (EPB) retraction tool\r\n-Service reset\r\n-Tire pressure sensors (TPMS)\r\n-Diesel Particulate Filter (DPF) regeneration\r\n-Battery registration\r\nAnd other helpful tools.\r\n\r\n\r\n*LIVE DATA\r\nMonitor live data and gain valuable insights, whether you're checking your own car's health or researching a used car purchase.\r\n\r\n-Launch control count\r\n-Mileage information\r\n-Airbag crashes count\r\n-Service interval info\r\n-Engine Turbo\r\nAnd others to keep your car running smoothly and efficiently.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n*For 2005/2008+ vehicles\r\n\r\n\r\nFor all cars with OBD port:\r\nBasic OBD Diagnostics\r\nBasic OBD2 Live Data\r\nEmissions Test Service tools\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nInformation and help: https://carista.com\r\nTerms of Use and Privacy Policy: https://carista.com/app-legal",
    "descriptionHTML": "Carista App is a mobile DIY car mechanic in the palm of your hands - code features, diagnose warning lights, monitor live data, and service your car.<br><br>Save time and money from visits to the workshop with Carista. Customize your car\u2019s behavior, unlock hidden features, diagnose dashboard warning lights, monitor real-time parameters, and perform simple DIY procedures quickly and easily. Advanced app settings available for certain Audi, BMW, Infiniti, Lexus, Land Rover, Lincoln, MINI, Nissan, Scion, SEAT, \u0160koda, Toyota, Volkswagen, and Ford models.<br><br><br>THE ALL-IN-ONE CAR TOOL<br>-Customize your car&#39;s behavior: unlock hidden features, including SFD-protected ones, and tailor your car to your preferences.<br>-Diagnose and Reset dashboard warning lights: quickly identify and resolve issues before they escalate into costly repairs.<br>-Monitor real-time parameters: stay informed about your car&#39;s health and performance with live data readings.<br>-Perform simple DIY procedures: save on routine maintenance and avoid lengthy workshop visits.<br><br><br>SUPPORTED VEHICLES<br>Carista App supports certain Audi, BMW, Infiniti, Lexus, Land Rover, Lincoln, MINI, Nissan, Scion, SEAT, \u0160koda, Toyota, Volkswagen and Ford models. Check if your car is supported here: https://carista.com/supported-cars<br><br><br>WHY THE CARISTA APP?<br>- A wide range of car brands supported.<br>- User-friendly and simple: plug the scanner, switch Bluetooth on, press \u201cConnect\u201d, see what your car is capable of.<br>- Brilliant customer service.<br>- Frequent updates: new features and brands.<br><br><br>HARDWARE<br>Experience the full potential of the Carista App by pairing it with the Carista EVO Scanner (and Carista OBD Scanner-white one-, not compatible with Ford brands and SFD-protected 2020+ VAG cars). While Carista App can also be used with other compatible OBD2 adapters such as OBDLink MX+, OBDLink CX, OBDLink MX Bluetooth or LX adapters, Kiwi3 adapter, or a genuine Bluetooth ELM327 v1.4 (ensuring it&#39;s not fake or defective). Discover more at: https://carista.com/en/adapters<br><br><br>PRICING<br>All paid features are available with an in-app purchase of our Pro functionality: an auto-renewable subscription at $59.99 USD/year or $29.99 USD/3 months or $14.99 USD/month. If you use the official Carista EVO Scanner, you will receive a free one-month trial of all paid features by picking the yearly subscription.<br>Price may vary based on currency and region.<br><br><br>KEY FEATURES (Exact feature availability depends on your vehicle).<br><br>*CUSTOMIZATIONS<br>Personalization of comfort &amp; convenience features of the car. More than 300 hidden features per brand.<br><br>-Gauge needle sweep at startup<br>-Start screen logo<br>-Virtual instrument cluster theme<br>-Lights: DRL, coming/ leaving-home<br>-Throttle response behavior<br>and more powerful features to enhance your experience!<br><br><br>*ADVANCED DIAGNOSTICS<br>Perform dealer-level electronic diagnostics (fault code checking and resetting) of all modules in the vehicle, including ABS, airbag, and other manufacturer-specific systems.<br><br><br>*SERVICE<br>Perform simple service procedures without the mechanic\u2019s help and spare yourself the long waiting time and extra costs at the workshop.<br><br>-Electronic parking brake (EPB) retraction tool<br>-Service reset<br>-Tire pressure sensors (TPMS)<br>-Diesel Particulate Filter (DPF) regeneration<br>-Battery registration<br>And other helpful tools.<br><br><br>*LIVE DATA<br>Monitor live data and gain valuable insights, whether you&#39;re checking your own car&#39;s health or researching a used car purchase.<br><br>-Launch control count<br>-Mileage information<br>-Airbag crashes count<br>-Service interval info<br>-Engine Turbo<br>And others to keep your car running smoothly and efficiently.<br><br><br><br><br>*For 2005/2008+ vehicles<br><br><br>For all cars with OBD port:<br>Basic OBD Diagnostics<br>Basic OBD2 Live Data<br>Emissions Test Service tools<br><br><br><br><br><br>Information and help: https://carista.com<br>Terms of Use and Privacy Policy: https://carista.com/app-legal",
